Redesign dashboard: FinBlade branded ops console

Rework web/dashboard.html into a branded NOC console using only theme variables
(no hard-coded colour): command bar with blade-mark wordmark, summary KPI strip
(occupancy / active alerts / cameras / peak density), live annotated feed with
CCTV scanlines + corner brackets, zone cards with severity brackets + density
meters (restricted zones show Intrusion), severity-striped alert feed with ack.
Reuses theme .fb-bracket/.fb-num/.fb-btn. Wired to live API (WS + 5s REST) + MJPEG.

run_cpu.py: zone-state POST now includes zone_name + restricted. Verified live on
the synthetic clip; 84 tests green (incl. theme-compliance).

